Hi {Owner},

I build websites and estimating tools for commercial electrical contractors around {City}. Looking at the {Business Name} site, I couldn't find where a general contractor's estimator sends plans and a bid date, or projects grouped by building type.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: a bid invitation page with plan upload, project pages for healthcare, education, industrial and tenant improvement work, a safety and prequalification pack, and a careers page with the apprenticeship path, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, changes and adding new projects. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would twenty minutes with you and your estimating lead work this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
